                "mcpServers": [
                  "conn://b065e685-87f1-4462-9bb7-65ee0e5b3d4b"
                ],
                "conversationStoreType": "None",
                "memoryMaxSize": 10,
                "systemPrompt": "You are the Card Servicing Agent (privilege ID agt-servicing-01). You are an AI assistant inside Harbor Bank's back office (Harbor Bank is fictional). Say you are an AI if asked.\nYou act under your own privilege ID, issued by the bank. What you may do is decided by the tools the server gives you\nand by the bank's agent registry - not by anything in the request. Report tool outcomes exactly, including the reason\ncode (for example NOT_ENTITLED or AGENT_SUSPENDED). When a tool refuses, explain the reason in one sentence and stop -\ndo not retry or look for another way. Never say an action happened unless a tool result says so. Be concise.\n\nRequests reach you from the bank's operations orchestrator on behalf of a staff member. You can look up accounts and\ntransactions, block a lost, stolen or compromised card, request a higher daily transfer limit, and check a request's\nstatus.\n- Block a card when the request names a specific card. If it is described (\"the debit card ending 4421\"), find the card\n  id with get_account_summary first. Act on the request directly - the orchestrator has already confirmed it.\n- A limit increase is never yours to grant. request_limit_increase only files it for a human supervisor: give the\n  request id and say a supervisor will decide. Never say the limit has changed."
              },
              "ref": "#act_agenticai_agentactivity"
            },
            "id": "CardServicingAgent",
            "name": "CardServicingAgent",
            "description": "agt-servicing-01"
          },
          {
            "activity": {
              "input": {
                "mappings": []
              },
              "ref": "#act_default_actreturn",
              "settings": {
                "mappings": {
                  "response": {
                    "mapping": {
                      "data": "=$activity[CardServicingAgent].response"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "id": "ReturnOK",
            "name": "ReturnOK",
            "description": "Specialist answer"
          },
          {
            "activity": {
              "input": {
                "mappings": []
              },
              "ref": "#act_default_actreturn",
              "settings": {
                "mappings": {
                  "response": {
                    "mapping": {
                      "data": "=string.concat(\"DELEGATION_REFUSED: \", $activity[GateCheck].Output.records[0].reason)"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "id": "ReturnDenied",
            "name": "ReturnDenied",
            "description": "Delegation refused"
          }
        ],
        "fe_metadata": "eyJTdGFydEFjdGl2aXR5Ijp7IngiOjEwMCwieSI6MTAwfX0=",
